# Figures and results (CSV/JSON/TXT) ARE tracked on purpose — they are the
# portfolio evidence (plots, metrics, SHAP outputs) shown in the README and
# on GitHub without requiring a clone + full pipeline run to view.

# The raw dataset (data/WA_Fn-UseC_-Telco-Customer-Churn.csv) is also tracked
# on purpose: it is IBM's small, public, non-sensitive Telco sample dataset,
# and keeping it in the repo makes `python main.py` reproducible immediately
# after cloning. See README.md "Dataset" section.

